  "notes": "Both images show the same front/back artwork; each transcribed separately. Board silkscreen (5V, GND, 3V3, 0-5, TX, RX, 13, 14, 10, 9, 8, 7, 6; back 23, 24, 25, 28) put first in functions. The back view's side pads carry no callouts and repeat the front castellations, so they were not transcribed again. The 'WS2812 RGB LED used pin' box differs between images (GP27 in image 1, GP29 in image 2); it and the 'Antenna Switch used pin GP26' box describe on-board use, not wiring points."
